    "description": {
      "value": "This golden ring has three diamonds set into its face. The ring replicates the effects of an 8th-level spell turning with a counteract modifier of +35, possibly causing the triggering spell to reflect back on its caster. The ring can reflect no more than 9 total levels of spells per day. If you activate the ring to reflect a spell that would exceed this limit, the attempt fails, but the attempted usage of the ring does not count toward the daily limit."
